. A parent field injects the box chrome."},"1420":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-16","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure","content":"**`CornerActions`** - an always-visible structural row for actions placed at a surface corner."},"1421":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-17","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"Each container works in two modes:"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-18","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."},"1423":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-19","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#hybrid-styling","content":"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."},"1424":{"id":"/docs/components/structure-20","page_id":"/docs/components/structure","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/structure#examples","content":"<Meta of={Stories} name=\"Overview"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/components/switch","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"page","content":"Switch","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Components"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-0","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/components/switch","content":"A binary toggle control that switches a setting between on and off states, communicated via the WAI-ARIA switch role."},"1427":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-1","page_id":"/docs/components/switch","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/components/switch#features","content":"Features"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/components/switch-2"