ondary content and/or actions (a `<footer>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[1419,"**`Group`** — semantic grouping container for field item controls. A parent field injects the box chrome."],[1416,"**`Header`** — the top region: title area and optional trailing close (a `<header>` row that spaces its contents apart)."],[714,"**`icon.content`**: Overrides the BentoIllustration component - affects SVG transformations (rotate, flip), accessibility attributes (`role`, `focusable`, `aria-labelledby`), viewBox calculations, and final SVG element rendering"],[713,"**`icon`**: Overrides the entire BentoIcon component - affects icon loading, caching, sprite/SVG mode switching, data attributes, and the overall icon wrapper"],[721,"**`ondemand(loader)`**: Register an asynchronous icon loader (returns unregister function)"],[722,"**`parser(svgString)`**: Parse SVG strings into React elements"],[720,"**`set(icons)`**: Synchronously add icons to the store"],[1597,"**`size` is the tier.** The eyebrow reads it on the `detail` ramp, the title on `heading`, and\nthe body on `body`, so there is no table to memorize. Without `size`, the lockup follows the\nsurrounding size scope. A tier is the same at every container width."],[1170,"**A step isn't clickable:** it has no `onPress`, so it's inert by design. Add `onPress` to make it interactive."],[702,"**Accessibility ready**: Built-in support for screen readers and keyboard navigation"],[239,"**Accessibility ready**: Keyboard navigation, screen reader support, and semantic HTML"],[706,"**Accessibility**: `aria-label`, `aria-describedby`, `role`, `title`"],[1423,"**Adopted** - inside a parent that provides its context (e.g. `Modal`), it picks up that parent's styling and spacing automatically. Consumer props still win over the adopted defaults."],[1561,"**Adornments**: Fixed text or icons before or after the input (e.g. `$`, `.00`, `px`) are composed inside `Group`, positioned by source order"],[1595,"**An explicit prop on a child