er:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[90,"**Child props win** over Alert's context defaults. Classes merge. Local style properties win over context styles."],[88,"**Choose the glyph on Icon**: for example `<Icon slot=\"indicator\" icon=\"alert\" />`. The indicator is decorative. Omit it when the message stands alone. Override its size with `style` when you need a different dimension than Alert's default."],[761,"**Client-Side Hydration**: The sprite sheet is generated and injected after hydration, causing a brief paint event"],[701,"**Color inheritance**: Uses `currentColor` by default for seamless theme integration"],[1560,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, `Input` or `TextArea`, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Omitting `Group` leaves the control as a direct field child with box chrome. Use an explicit `Group` for controls or adornments"],[1347,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, a `Button slot=\"trigger\"`, `SelectOptions`, and optional `Text` / `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[1034,"**Composable interior**: Compose `Label`, the control, `Text slot=\"description\"`, and `FieldError`. Nothing is added for you, and what you write keeps the order you wrote it in"],[956,"**Composable rows**: Each `MenuItem` renders a string label or composed content (icons, checkboxes). Use render props (`isSelected`, `selectionMode`) and pass `textValue` for typeahead."],[86,"**Compose siblings inside Alert**: optional `Icon slot=\"indicator\"`, `Content` for the title and body, optional `ButtonGroup`, and optional `CloseButton`. Use `Button slot=\"close\"` when the dismiss control needs a visible label. Pass `onPress` on the close control and hide the alert from the parent."],[1349,"**Composed in another field**: Use `variant=\"control\"` to sit inside another field's `Group`, as a country-code select beside a phone `Input`"],[932,"**Com