ty**: Verify CDN is accessible"],[1169,"**No step is highlighted:** `currentStep` is omitted, negative, or out of range. Set it to the active step's 0-based index."],[698,"**On-demand loading**: Icons are loaded asynchronously from CDN only when needed"],[763,"**Performance Benefits:**"],[959,"**Popover or drawer**: Open from `MenuTrigger` for positioned overlays, or place `Menu` in a `Drawer` for full-screen/mobile."],[780,"**Preload common icons**: Consider preloading frequently used icons"],[773,"**Provide fallback content** for critical icons to handle loading states"],[1200,"**Radio Button:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focused`, `data-disabled`"],[1199,"**RadioGroup Container:** `data-invalid`, `data-disabled`, `data-required`, `data-readonly`, `data-orientation`"],[933,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria ListBox for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead."],[1355,"**React Aria integration**: Built on React Aria Select for accessibility, keyboard navigation, and typeahead"],[887,"**Recommended default**: Use `Flex` for most layouts. Since it extends `Box`, you get all `Box` capabilities without needing to nest components."],[764,"**Reduced DOM Size**: Path data stored once instead of duplicated"],[759,"**Reference Rendering**: Each icon renders as a lightweight `<use>` element that references the sprite"],[233,"**Responsive behavior**: Auto-sizing with horizontal scrolling for many data points, sticky axes"],[264,"**Responsive sizing**: `useParentSize` hook provides efficient resize detection with debouncing (15ms)"],[1676,"**Right** — when the group represents utility or contextual controls (e.g. grid/list view toggle)."],[972,"**Roles**: Single-select items use `menuitemradio`; multiple-select use `menuitemcheckbox`. Unselectable items use `menuitem`."],[238,"**RTL support**: Full right-to-left layout support for international audiences _(in development)_"],[262,"**Scales**: VisX's `scaleBand` and `scaleLinear` for efficient coordinate mapping"],[259,"**Screen reader support**: Semantic HTML structure with proper ARIA attributes"],[1322,"**SegmentedController Container:** `data-disabled`"],[1323,"**SegmentedControllerItem:** `data-selected`, `data-hovered`, `data-pressed`, `data-focus-visible`, `data-disabled`"],[973,"**Selection indicators are decorative**: A checkbox, radio check, or chevron-right icon is purely visual. The item owns the `aria-checked` state."],[979,"**Selection modes**: Set `selectionMode` on `Menu` (all items) or per-`MenuGroup` (only group). Use controlled state for tracking."],[958,"**Separators and submenus**: `Separator` divides items. `SubmenuTrigger` nests a `Popover` + `Menu` for hierarchies."],[1414,"**Shared structural containers.** These generic, layout-only components are the building blocks for composing a component's interior (a `Modal`, a card, a panel). They are semantic containers built on `Flex`, so they accept the same layout props (`direction`, `gap`, `alignItems`, `justifyContent`, `padding`, ...)."],[394,"**Shift + Tab**: Moves focus to the previous checkbox"],[293,"**Simplify tooltips**: If tooltips are complex, consider using simpler content or disabling them"],[231,"**Single and multi-series support**: Display one or multiple data series with grouped bars"],[1350,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"multiple\"` to allow multiple values"],[957,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"` on `Menu` or per-`MenuGroup`. Use controlled state or `defaultSelectedKeys` for uncontrolled menus."],[929,"**Single or multiple selection**: Set `selectionMode=\"single\"` or `\"multiple\"`."],[1566,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, description, error, and composed controls; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope. An explicit `size` on a part still wins for that part"],[1036,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets its label, input, steppers, description, and error; without it, the field follows the surrounding scope"],[1353,"**Sizes**: The field is a `SizeProvider`. `size` (`sm`, `md`, `lg`) sets the label, trigger, and options, which open at the same size even though they render in a portal. Without it, the Select follows the surrounding scope"],[1205,"**Space**: Select the focused radio button"],[393,"**Space**: Toggles the focused checkbox"],[1326,"**Space/Enter**: Select the focused segment"],[758,"**Sprite Sheet Creation**: A hidden SVG sprite sheet is automatically injected into the DOM containing symbol definitions"],[768,"**SSR Limitation**: Sprite references render empty until client-side hydration"],[977,"**Stable IDs**: Give each `MenuItem` a unique `id` for React tracking across re-renders."],[1422,"**Standalone** - with no parent context it renders with its own structural defaults and looks the same everywhere."],[1035,"**Steppers**: A stepper is a `Group` holding `Button slot=\"decrement\"`, an `Input`, and `Button slot=\"increment\"`. Left empty, each button takes its icon and `variant=\"control\"` from the field, so no icon imports are needed. Compose a bare `Input` instead for a plain numeric input"],[267,"**Sticky axes**: Positioned absolutely to remain visible during scroll"],[256,"**Sticky y-axis**: The y-axis remains visible during horizontal scroll"],[708,"**Styling**: `className`, `style`, `data-*` attributes"],[980,"**Submenus**: Use `SubmenuTrigger` with `chevron-right` icon. Keyboard navigation is automatic."],[92,"**Surface props stay on Alert**: `className`, `style`, `ref`, native attributes, and `data-emphasis` for theming."],[752,"**SVG Parsing**: The fetched SVG string is parsed into a React element using `@bento/svg-parser`"],[392,"**Tab**: Moves focus to the next/previous checkbox"],[1202,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the radio group"],[1324,"**Tab**: Moves focus to/from the segmented controller"],[1594,"**The